 font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">이전</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">~</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">2024.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">7.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: -0.9pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12pt;\">1.)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">계속 주민등록상 경기도에 거주한 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">국내 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">) </span><span style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">재학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -31.9pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size